{
  "rationale": "Use a minimal plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in small deterministic specifications. The policy gives random_walk in clear exploration, inserts a short move_forward phase for coverage, routes every obstacle through a one-shot turn recovery, prefers clockwise for left/front and counterclockwise for right, and uses full_rotate only in a dedicated last-resort recovery state. Action states self-loop on path_clear so uncontrollables do not preempt the intended pulse, while obstacle events can still force safe recovery.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate uncontrollable perception from controllable motion capability",
    "Use one policy automaton for exploration/recovery and one alternation automaton to avoid long forward streaks"
